
# Stage 2 — Compound Data Enrichment Pipeline

## Overview

This stage enriches the list of phytochemical compounds extracted in **Stage 1** by retrieving molecular, biological, toxicological, and interaction data from multiple public databases.

The pipeline is **sequential and dependency-driven**, starting from compound names and standardizing identifiers using PubChem.

